{"id":"your-voice-after-midnight","v":1,"lines":[{"t0":15.22,"t1":22.62,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"It's half past twelve, the city's asleep,","w":[[15.22,16.12],[16.12,16.38],[16.38,16.82],[16.82,17.8],[17.8,20.16],[20.16,20.86],[20.86,21.42]]},{"t0":24.37,"t1":31.36,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"There's a secret the silence refuses to keep.","w":[[24.37,25.06],[25.06,25.16],[25.16,25.84],[25.84,26.24],[26.24,27.14],[27.14,29.1],[29.1,29.44],[29.44,30.16]]},{"t0":33.18,"t1":40.14,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"My window is open, the curtains move,","w":[[33.18,33.44],[33.44,33.72],[33.72,33.84],[33.84,34.68],[34.68,37.08],[37.08,37.86],[37.86,38.94]]},{"t0":41.03,"t1":49.38,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"And every little shadow reminds me of you.","w":[[41.03,41.38],[41.38,41.88],[41.88,42.36],[42.36,43.18],[43.18,44.62],[44.62,45.7],[45.7,46.42],[46.42,48.18]]},{"t0":51.23,"t1":54.18,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"I tell myself that the feeling has gone,","w":[[51.23,51.4],[51.4,51.7],[51.7,52.2],[52.2,52.58],[52.58,52.94],[52.94,53.58],[53.58,53.9],[53.9,54.16]]},{"t0":54.18,"t1":58.43,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"That the night is short and the day will come.","w":[[54.18,54.61],[54.61,54.96],[54.96,55.48],[55.48,55.74],[55.74,56.58],[56.58,56.76],[56.76,56.98],[56.98,57.48],[57.48,57.9],[57.9,58.41]]},{"t0":58.43,"t1":62.62,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"Then my phone lights up in the dark again,","w":[[58.43,58.86],[58.86,59.08],[59.08,59.52],[59.52,60.3],[60.3,60.7],[60.7,61.04],[61.04,61.2],[61.2,61.7],[61.7,62.6]]},{"t0":62.62,"t1":66.66,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"And I'm right back where I've always been.","w":[[62.62,63.2],[63.2,63.48],[63.48,63.76],[63.76,64.12],[64.12,64.44],[64.44,64.84],[64.84,65.34],[65.34,65.9]]},{"t0":66.66,"t1":69.72,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Your voice after midnight,","w":[[66.66,66.82],[66.82,67.2],[67.2,67.52],[67.52,68.52]]},{"t0":71.34,"t1":74.52,"sec":"Chorus","text":"A light in the blue.","fb":1},{"t0":74.8,"t1":77.6,"sec":"Chorus","text":"One word and the whole world","w":[[74.8,75.06],[75.06,75.49],[75.49,75.84],[75.84,76.16],[76.16,76.46],[76.46,77.58]]},{"t0":77.6,"t1":82.58,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Comes running back to you.","w":[[77.6,78.36],[78.36,78.86],[78.86,79.54],[79.54,80.02],[80.02,81.38]]},{"t0":83.38,"t1":86.68,"sec":"Chorus","text":"We live in the silence,","w":[[83.38,83.64],[83.64,84.06],[84.06,84.16],[84.16,84.3],[84.3,85.48]]},{"t0":87.14,"t1":90.74,"sec":"Chorus","text":"We hide in the sound.","w":[[87.14,87.6],[87.6,88.08],[88.08,88.52],[88.52,88.84],[88.84,89.54]]},{"t0":91.82,"t1":95.06,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Your voice after midnight","w":[[91.82,92.08],[92.08,92.48],[92.48,92.8],[92.8,93.86]]},{"t0":98.68,"t1":103.28,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Still turns me around.","w":[[98.68,99.2],[99.2,100.52],[100.52,100.84],[100.84,102.08]]},{"t0":114.42,"t1":117.58,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"We never promised forever would stay,","w":[[114.42,114.68],[114.68,115.1],[115.1,115.66],[115.66,116.46],[116.46,117.08],[117.08,117.56]]},{"t0":117.58,"t1":121.52,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"We just let the hours carry us away.","w":[[117.58,118.62],[118.62,118.88],[118.88,119.12],[119.12,119.44],[119.44,119.84],[119.84,120.38],[120.38,120.84],[120.84,121.5]]},{"t0":121.52,"t1":124.68,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"Now there's a thousand miles between,","w":[[121.52,122.08],[122.08,122.46],[122.46,122.56],[122.56,123.52],[123.52,124.02],[124.02,124.66]]},{"t0":124.68,"t1":130.28,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"And you're closer than you've ever been.","w":[[124.68,126.34],[126.34,126.64],[126.64,127.08],[127.08,127.6],[127.6,128],[128,128.36],[128.36,129.08]]},{"t0":130.9,"t1":134.16,"sec":"Bridge","text":"Maybe we're a story without an end,","w":[[130.9,131.42],[131.42,131.8],[131.8,131.94],[131.94,132.48],[132.48,133.12],[133.12,133.72],[133.72,134.14]]},{"t0":134.16,"t1":138.5,"sec":"Bridge","text":"Two strangers who keep finding each other again.","w":[[134.16,134.94],[134.94,135.6],[135.6,135.96],[135.96,136.22],[136.22,136.66],[136.66,137.14],[137.14,137.68],[137.68,138.48]]},{"t0":138.5,"t1":142.88,"sec":"Bridge","text":"Maybe tomorrow we'll finally let go,","w":[[138.5,139.72],[139.72,140.66],[140.66,141.42],[141.42,142.06],[142.06,142.48],[142.48,142.86]]},{"t0":142.88,"t1":149.5,"sec":"Bridge","text":"But tonight there's something we both still know.","w":[[142.88,143.28],[143.28,144.02],[144.02,145.7],[145.7,146.26],[146.26,146.68],[146.68,147.1],[147.1,147.62],[147.62,148.3]]},{"t0":150.51,"t1":154,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"Your voice after midnight,","w":[[150.51,150.94],[150.94,151.3],[151.3,151.6],[151.6,152.8]]},{"t0":154.93,"t1":158.04,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"A light in the blue.","w":[[154.93,155.1],[155.1,155.48],[155.48,155.74],[155.74,155.92],[155.92,156.84]]},{"t0":158.79,"t1":161.64,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"One word and the whole world","w":[[158.79,159.14],[159.14,159.55],[159.55,159.88],[159.88,160.12],[160.12,160.56],[160.56,161.62]]},{"t0":161.64,"t1":166.9,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"Comes running back to you.","w":[[161.64,162.46],[162.46,162.94],[162.94,163.58],[163.58,164.08],[164.08,165.7]]},{"t0":167.78,"t1":169.24,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"And when the morning","w":[[167.78,167.98],[167.98,168.24],[168.24,168.5],[168.5,169.22]]},{"t0":169.24,"t1":174.52,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"Turns the stars to gray,","w":[[169.24,171.3],[171.3,171.62],[171.62,172.26],[172.26,172.7],[172.7,173.32]]},{"t0":175.55,"t1":180.66,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"I'll still hear your voice","w":[[175.55,175.98],[175.98,176.32],[176.32,176.64],[176.64,176.96],[176.96,179.46]]},{"t0":182.81,"t1":187.3,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"Long after you fade away.","w":[[182.81,183.24],[183.24,184],[184,184.38],[184.38,184.92],[184.92,186.1]]}],"gloss":[{"w":"asleep","m":{"en":"sleeping","tr":"uykuda","fa":"خواب","es":"dormido"},"at":[[0,"asleep"]]},{"w":"shadow","m":{"en":"the dark shape that a thing makes when it blocks the light","tr":"gölge","fa":"سایه","es":"sombra"},"at":[[3,"shadow"]]},{"w":"remind (someone) of","m":{"en":"to make you think of a person or thing","tr":"(birini) hatırlatmak","fa":"یادِ (کسی) انداختن","es":"recordar a"},"at":[[3,"reminds me of"]]},{"w":"come running back","m":{"en":"to return quickly and with strong feeling","tr":"koşa koşa geri gelmek","fa":"دوون‌دوون برگشتن","es":"volver corriendo"},"at":[[11,"Comes running back"],[27,"Comes running back"]]},{"w":"closer than you've ever been","m":{"en":"nearer than at any time before","tr":"hiç olmadığın kadar yakın","fa":"نزدیک‌تر از همیشه","es":"más cerca que nunca"},"at":[[19,"closer than you've ever been"]]},{"w":"let go","m":{"en":"to stop holding; to accept that something is over","tr":"bırakmak, vazgeçmek","fa":"رها کردن، ول کردن","es":"soltar, dejar ir"},"at":[[22,"let go"]]}]}